  "description": "E-Curious? Supercharge your ride with the award-winning E-Sommet.\n\nDesigned by passionate mountain bikers to handle the most technical descents thanks to its aggressive geometry based on our hard charging Sommet enduro bike. The E-Sommet gives your ride a boost as you smash out more runs on your local trails than ever before. Experience the buzz of carving corners with pedal assist on both the climbs and the descents\n\nWith 3 power modes on the Vitus E-Sommet VRS powered by the Shimano Steps E8000 Motor (Eco, Trail, or Boost), you can ride at whatever intensity you wish. The E-Sommet VRS is equipped with 170mm travel Fox Float Performance eBike forks and Fox Float DPX 2 Performance Elite rear shock, Shimano XT 1x12 gearing and SRAM Guide RE brakes. Finished off with tubeless ready Maxxis tyres fitted DT Swiss H1700 wheels, there’s no doubting the power and prowess of the E-Sommet VRS.\n\nAlloy 27.5” frame with aggressive enduro geometry\n\nSHIMANO STEPS E8000 Motor\n\nEco, trail or Boost Power modes\n\nShimano XT 1x12 gearing\n\nSRAM Guide RE Brakes, 200mm rotors\n\nTubeless Ready Maxxis 3C Tyres",
